    <string name="guide_title">How to Use Bubble</string>
    <string name="guide_body">1. Set Bubble as your Default Digital Assistant (recommended, no Accessibility needed) OR enable Bubble Accessibility Service.\n\n2. Summon Bubble over any app by holding Home, swiping from a bottom corner, tapping the Accessibility button, or using the Quick Settings tile.\n\n3. Drag to adjust your selection frame, then tap Translate, Search Image, or any custom button on your Action Panel.\n\n4. Safe Mode protects banking, e-wallet, and password apps automatically and always respects Android FLAG_SECURE.</string>

